    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nB1 Energy Rating\nSherry FitzGerald Geraghty offer 10 Fairyhouse Lodge to the market, a 5 bedroom detached residence with garden room/home office (suite many uses), occupying a corner site in this ever popular and sought after development, located just off the Fairyhouse Road. The residence is immaculately presented, offers many extras and benefits from a beautiful modern kitchen with double ovens and a centre island/breakfast bar. The rooms are generous in proportion with many features throughout and the current owners have invested in improving the energy rating by installing triple glazing front and side, solar panels (5kw) and a Climote heating system. Fairyhouse Lodge is a much sought after address on the outskirts of the village of Ratoath where all services and amenities are catered for including local theatre and many sporting facilities. The location allows easy access to the M3 and M50 Interchange via the Fairyhouse Road and the Park & Ride facility at Dunboyne/Clonee. Dublin City Centre and Dublin International Airport are also a short drive.With reception rooms to suite all family ages and needs, a private, walled garden, an outdoor garden room, No 10 will tick most boxes of those seeking a substantial residence at an envious address, within easy striking distance of the Capital, neighbouring towns and villages.Viewing is by prior appointment and for transparency purposes, bidding is on line via the \"mysherryfitz\" bidding platform."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nHardwood front door and double glazed side panels, tiled floor, timber staircase, electric Velux window\n\nOffice / Reception Room - \nFitted out for optimum use, having hardwood flooring, coving and centre rose\n\nGuest WC and WHB - \nHart tiled walls, towel radiator, extractor fan\n\nSitting Room - \nBespoke fitted unit, Hardwood flooring, French doors to garden, coving and centre rose\n\nKitchen / Dining Room / Living Room - \nFitted with base and eye level storage cupboards, marble worktops, Island/breakfast bar with sockets, double ovens, extractor fan, tilt & turn door/window, door at dining space with window seat, feature roof light, tiled flooring, solid fuel stove in living area, wall radiator and recessed lighting. Feature barn door to utility room\n\nAncillary Room off Kitchen - \nFeature barn door from kitchen area, censor lighting, fitted storage cupboards, granite worktops, tiled floor\n\nBoot Room / Cloakroom - \nCensor lighting, tiled floor\n\nUtility Room - \nStorage cupboards, granite worktops, sink unit, tiled floor, Climote controls, uPVC exit door\n\nFamily Room - \nA generous room to retreat to with a book or homework\n\nUpstairs - \nHardwood staircase to landing area with carpet underfoot and access to attic space\n\nMain Bedroom - \nLocated at the front of the residence having wall to wall built in wardrobes\n\nEn-Suite Shower Room - \nTiled floor, pump shower, towel radiator and window for natural light and ventilation\n\nBedroom 2 - \nWalk in wardrobe, laminate flooring\n\nBedroom 3 - \nPositioned at the rear, having fitted wardrobe units, Velux window, access to storage in eaves\n\nBathroom - \nFully tiled, having bath, shower (pump) double sinks with large mirror, towel radiator, floating WC\n\nAiring Cupboard / Linen Closet - \nInsulated tank, immersion, tongue & groove flooring, censor for solar panels (heats water)\n\nBedroom 4 / Guest Bedroom - \nLaminate flooring\n\nShower Room - \nTiled flooring tiled shower, Velux window, access to storage in eaves\n\nOutside - \nGarden room / home gym / home office, double access doors and having heating and electrics laid on.Garden walled in with feature timber cladding in parts Side garden Garden shedPaved patios, outdoor lightingElectric mower dockWild garden with fruit trees\n\nIncluded in Sale - \nCarpets, window dressings, light fixtures & fittings, ovens, hob, extractor fan, integrated appliances and garden shed NOTE: Electric mower and charging dock available to purchase\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>B1 Energy Rating</li><li>Much sought after address</li><li>Occupying a corner position in the development</li><li>Very private setting</li><li>Garden room / home gym / home office </li><li>Walled in private gardens</li><li>Feature kitchen with feature roof light</li><li>Bespoke unit in sitting room</li><li>Triple glazing to front and side of residence</li><li>Feature barn door in kitchen</li><li>Lovely bathrooms and tiling </li><li>Mains services, OFCH, Solar panels, wireless alarm, EV charger</ul>"
      },
